    Document why the build tests Java 23 (#8172)
    
    Java 23 is a non-LTS release that no longer receives updates, which
    makes it look like an oversight next to Java 21. It is there because
    Karaf 4.4.x does not run on Java 25 yet. Say so in the workflow before
    someone helpfully swaps it.
    
